==Trivia==
*This is the second item in the game with the ''"Rakta"'' prefix, the first one being the [[Rakta Syandana]].
** Rakta is derived from the Sanskrit word'' rakta '', meaning blood.
*Prior to {{ver|16}}, the Rakta Ballistica could not be recolored, with only its energy color being customizable.
**Its appearance prior to {{ver|16}} appeared to be based on [[Wraith]] weapons. The weapon's current inventory icon shows what the Rakta Ballistica formerly looked like.
*When the Rakta Ballistica was first introduced, its charged attack dealt primarily {{D|Impact}} damage instead of {{D|Puncture}} damage. The primary damage type changed in {{ver|15.16}} (along with several other improvements to the weapon) to be more consistent with the regular version.

